      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nAddresses the GLM-4.7 MoE part of #57827. When a tool call ends without closing its final `</arg_value>` tag, final conversion drops that argument. This change preserves it.\r\n\r\nAdds streaming and non-streaming regression tests for both closed and unclosed final values. This is separate from #58349, which fixes MiniMax M2, and #53739, which changes the shared streaming engine.\r\n\r\nAI assistance was used to develop this change.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\nRun the focused parser suite:\r\n\r\n`VLLM_TARGET_DEVICE=cpu .venv/bin/python -m pytest --confcutdir=tests/parser/engine tests/parser/engine/test_glm47_moe.py -v`\r\n\r\nRun the repository's pre-commit hooks on the changed files.\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\n- 18 GLM parser tests passed, including the new regression cases.\r\n- All applicable pre-commit hooks passed.\r\n- No model inference evaluation was run. This is deterministic post-generation parsing, covered by CPU-only parser tests.",
